1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,390
Unit three. Places we live in.
第三单元：我们居住的地方。

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:06,570
What can we see in a community?
我们能在社区里看到什么？

3
00:00:07,892 --> 00:00:10,292
Good afternoon!
下午好！

4
00:00:10,592 --> 00:00:12,992
Good afternoon!
下午好！

5
00:00:13,292 --> 00:00:18,092
Your neighbours are very friendly.
你的邻居们非常友好。

6
00:00:19,392 --> 00:00:22,112
Yes, they are.
是的，他们很友好。

7
00:00:22,412 --> 00:00:24,972
There is a playground.
这里有一个游乐场。

8
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:28,152
We often play there.
我们经常在那里玩。

9
00:00:29,475 --> 00:00:31,555
That's nice.
那真不错。

10
00:00:31,855 --> 00:00:35,055
There is also a nice park over there.
那边还有一个漂亮的公园。

11
00:00:35,355 --> 00:00:38,715
Let's go and see!
我们去看看吧！

12
00:00:40,017 --> 00:00:46,097
Park. Shop. Hospital. Playground.
公园。商店。医院。游乐场。

13
00:00:46,397 --> 00:00:48,797
We're at the park.
我们在公园里。

14
00:00:49,097 --> 00:00:51,977
Look! There is a shop.
看！这里有一家商店。

15
00:00:52,277 --> 00:00:55,157
Great! Let's go and see.
太好了！我们去看看吧。

16
00:00:56,475 --> 00:01:01,915
This is a bus stop. These are toilets.
这是公交站。这是公共厕所。

17
00:01:02,215 --> 00:01:07,655
There is a hospital.
这里有一家医院。

18
00:01:07,955 --> 00:01:11,475
There is also a playground.
这里还有一个游乐场。

19
00:01:12,808 --> 00:01:16,968
This is a library.
这是一座图书馆。

20
00:01:17,268 --> 00:01:21,268
Wow! There are so many books.
哇！这里有这么多书。

21
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:26,600
There is a taijiquan club.
这里有一个太极拳俱乐部。

22
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:30,580
There are many people.
这里有很多人。

23
00:01:31,892 --> 00:01:35,892
There is a gym too.
这里还有一座体育馆。

24
00:01:36,192 --> 00:01:39,872
Great! Let's do some sports.
太好了！我们做些运动吧。

25
00:01:41,183 --> 00:01:42,303
Take a walk.
散步。

26
00:01:42,603 --> 00:01:45,963
There is a beautiful park.
这里有一个美丽的公园。

27
00:01:46,263 --> 00:01:50,103
I often take a walk there.
我经常在那里散步。

28
00:01:51,433 --> 00:01:52,873
Go shopping.
购物。

29
00:01:53,173 --> 00:01:55,893
There is a shop.
这里有一家商店。

30
00:01:56,193 --> 00:01:57,953
I go shopping there.
我在那里购物。

31
00:01:59,267 --> 00:02:01,347
We can see a doctor.
我们可以看医生。

32
00:02:01,647 --> 00:02:05,327
There is a hospital.
这里有一家医院。

33
00:02:05,627 --> 00:02:08,507
I see a doctor there.
我在那里看医生。

34
00:02:09,808 --> 00:02:11,408
Do sports.
做运动。

35
00:02:11,708 --> 00:02:14,268
There is a playground.
这里有一个游乐场。

36
00:02:14,568 --> 00:02:16,648
I do sports there.
我在那里做运动。

37
00:02:17,975 --> 00:02:22,935
Back. Black. Duck. Sock. Tick.
回来。黑色的。鸭子。短袜。打勾。

38
00:02:24,267 --> 00:02:27,147
Some ducks are in the park.
公园里有几只鸭子。

39
00:02:27,447 --> 00:02:30,327
The poor ducklings feel cold there.
可怜的小鸭子在那里觉得冷。

40
00:02:31,642 --> 00:02:34,202
Some nice children go back home,
几个善良的孩子回到家里，

41
00:02:34,502 --> 00:02:37,062
For black socks they can wear.
为小鸭子找来能穿的黑袜子。

42
00:02:38,392 --> 00:02:42,712
There is a shop in our dream community.
我们的梦想社区里有一家商店。

43
00:02:43,012 --> 00:02:46,052
People can go shopping there.
人们可以在那里购物。

44
00:02:47,392 --> 00:02:50,432
There is a playground.
这里有一个游乐场。

45
00:02:50,732 --> 00:02:53,452
Children can have fun there.
孩子们可以在那里开心地玩。

46
00:02:54,767 --> 00:02:57,647
Now, tell us about your community.
现在，介绍一下你的社区吧。

47
00:03:02,183 --> 00:03:04,903
There is a park in my community.
我的社区里有一个公园。

48
00:03:05,203 --> 00:03:07,923
I often play there with my friends.
我经常和朋友们在那里玩。

49
00:03:08,223 --> 00:03:11,263
Great work! See you next time!
真棒！我们下次再见！
